WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.537
Lab 1 runs on a laptop
with Python and no tenant.

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.289
First, lint Learn's three
samples as published:

3
00:00:06.289 --> 00:00:11.067
the first two have several findings each,
unpinned actions and latest versions

4
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:15.338
among them, and the Government sample
fails because it isn't valid at all.

5
00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:18.413
Then lint the chapter's own
workflow, and it's clean.

6
00:00:18.413 --> 00:00:21.747
Print the Defense cloud's
profile to see its hosts,

7
00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:24.838
and try a cloud name that
doesn't exist: refused.

8
00:00:24.838 --> 00:00:28.699
Then record the first day's run
as a baseline and package it.

9
00:00:28.699 --> 00:00:32.590
Note the manifest hash; the next
package will point back to it.
